0 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a aria-current="page" class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian bg-obsidian text-major lg:bg-emerald-accent lg:text-[#141412]" href="/acceptable-use">Acceptable Use</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/copyright">Copyright &amp; Takedowns</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/subprocessors">Subprocessors</a></li><li class="shrink-0"><a class="block whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border px-3 py-2 text-sm transition lg:rounded-lg lg:border-0 lg:px-3 lg:py-2 border-obsidian/15 text-obsidian/70 hover:bg-muted-beige/60 hover:text-obsidian" href="/credits">Credits &amp; Licences</a></li></ul></nav><main id="main-content" class="min-w-0"><article class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-obsidian/50">Effective <!-- -->30 September 2026</p><h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Acceptable<!-- --> <em class="text-obsidian/70">Use</em></h1><div class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-obsidian/75">Make great videos. This policy lists the few things you may not use <!-- -->Captionit<!-- --> for. It is part of our <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>.</div><div class="mt-10 space-y-10"><section id="content" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#content" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Content you may not upload or create</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><ul><li>Child sexual abuse material, or any sexual content involving minors. We report it to the authorities.</li><li>Content that is illegal where you live or where you publish it.</li><li>Content that infringes someone else’s copyright, trademark, privacy or publicity rights, including videos you do not have permission to use.</li><li>Recordings of people made or shared in breach of the law (for example without the consent the law requires).</li><li>Harassment, threats, or content that promotes violence or hatred against people for who they are.</li><li>Deceptive content meant to defraud or mislead people, including captions that impersonate a real person or organisation or misrepresent what someone said.</li><li>Malware, spam, or content designed to manipulate elections or public health information.</li></ul></div></section><section id="service" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#service" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Using the service fairly</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><ul><li>Do not try to access other people’s accounts, projects or files, or get around security, rate limits or plan limits.</li><li>Do not probe, scan or load-test the service, or interfere with its operation, without our written permission. Security researchers: please report issues to <!-- -->work.techhacksai@gmail.com<!-- -->; we welcome responsible disclosure.</li><li>Do not resell access or create accounts automatically.</li><li>Do not scrape the service, copy the looks library, or use the service to build a competing product.</li><li>Do not modify the Companion app to send us falsified jobs or results.</li></ul></div></section><section id="enforcement" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#enforcement" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">What happens if the rules are broken</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>We may remove content, pause jobs, limit features, or suspend or close accounts, depending on how serious the problem is, and we may report illegal activity. Where it is safe and lawful we will tell you what happened and how to appeal: reply to our message or write to <!-- -->work.techhacksai@gmail.com<!-- -->.</p></div></section><section id="report" class="scroll-mt-24"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl"><a href="#report" class="hover:underline hover:decoration-orange-accent hover:decoration-2 hover:underline-offset-4">Report a problem</a></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 leading-relaxed text-obsidian/80 [&amp;_a]:font-medium [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:decoration-orange-accent [&amp;_a]:decoration-2 [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-4 [&amp;_li]:ml-5 [&amp;_li]:list-disc [&amp;_li]:pl-1 [&amp;_strong]:text-obsidian [&amp;_ul]:space-y-1.5"><p>Seen something that breaks these rules? Email <!-- -->work.techhacksai@gmail.com<!-- --> with a link or description. For copyright complaints, follow the <a href="/copyright">Copyright &amp; Takedowns</a> process.</p></div></section></div><p class="mt-14 rounded-2xl border border-obsidian/10 bg-muted-beige/40 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-obsidian/70">Questions about this document? Write to <strong class="text-obsidian">work.techhacksai@gmail.com</strong>. <!-- -->Parvez Achhan Ali Siddiqui, an individual (sole proprietor) trading as Captionit<!-- -->, <!-- -->India<!-- -->.</p></article><!--$--><!--/$--></main></div><footer class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#FFFFEB]/10 bg-[#1E1E1B] pt-20 pb-10 text-[#FFFFEB]"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-6 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:gap-16 pb-16"><div class="space-y-4"><h3 class="font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FFFFEB]/50">Product</h3><ul class="space-y-0.5 text-sm text-[#FFFFEB]/75 lg:space-y-2.5"><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/#how">How it works</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34D399] hover:underline underline-offset-4 lg:min-h-0" href="/auto-caption-generator">Auto caption generator</a></li><li><a class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center transition-colors hover:text-[#34